                                                "sense_id": "eee434f9-d9dd-3e09-bf4e-92462bab5878",
                                                "text": "2005, James D. Hunt, An American Looks at Gandhi, Bibliophile South Asia, page 37 http://books.google.com/books?id=kNvTdX52nw8C&pg=PA37&dq=tolstoyan&lr=\nThis essay will look first at Gandhi's knowledge of Tolstoy and proceed to the persons, organizations, and books that enlarged and enriched Gandhi's knowledge of Tolstoyan values."
